    "description": {
      "content": "The WordPress core search controller, exposed anonymously on gothamgreens.com. Returns lightweight records (id, title, url, type, subtype) across Journal posts and site pages — the same index that powers on-site search. Derived from the live route index and verified with an anonymous probe returning HTTP 200.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Gotham Greens",
